        "answer": {
          "short": "$0$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}w^3-10w^2&=10^3-10\\times10^2\\\\w^3-10w^2&=1000-10\\times100\\\\w^3-10w^2&=1000-1000\\\\w^3-10w^2&=0\\end{align*}$$",
